The bare ladder is currently on `easy` (\(n=40\)); the first oracle call is still running. The generated witness is 40 integers at this rung, while the solver must reconstruct the maximal-clique tree from the graph and align it with an independently relabelled host.
diff --git a/gen_2011_11670.py b/gen_2011_11670.py
