The first hard-preset oracle is still reasoning. If `hard` is solved, `escalate()` will first add uniformly distributed edge-model multiplicity at fixed 96-entry answer length, so the haystack grows without lengthening the witness.
diff --git a/gen_2011_11670.py b/gen_2011_11670.py
