+| Arm | Solved / attempts | Status |
+|---|---:|---|
+| bare (`hard`) | 0/2 | incomplete; third attempt blocked |
+| structural hint | 0/0 | not run |
+| placebo hint | 0/0 | not run |
+
+`hinted - placebo` is therefore undefined (stored provisionally as `0.0`, with
